  "name": "equal",
  "title": "30 + 30 suns",
  "line": "Two black holes like LIGO's first catch spiral in from 12 Hz; the last orbit takes 27 ms.",
  "equation": "x'' = -M x / r^3 + (8/5) eta M^2 / r^3 [ (3 v^2 + 17 M / (3 r)) rdot n - (v^2 + 3 M / r) v ];  h_ij = 2 Qdd_ij^TT / R",
